      "text": "1. Pursuant to the provisions of subd. 9 of Section 108 of the Judiciary Law, as added by L. 1965, c. 382, the Mayor elects to provide that the deduction from the salary or compensation of any employee or officer made pursuant to Section 108 of the Judiciary Law, need not be made and that no contribution in lieu thereof need be made during the one-year period commencing with July first, nineteen hundred sixty-five.",
